 video \"",{"t":"chicot seduto su una sedia - sopravvissuti ai vampiri - Vampire Survivors","x":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hDvZkaNR1s8"},"\" showcasing Chicot in the title and the thumbnail, the video features ",{"i":"Sprite-Jimbo.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:jimbo"}," ",{"t":"Jimbo","r":"character:jimbo"}," instead. Though, among the featured characters, Jimbo's name is listed but not Chicot."]},{"c":["Prior to v1.15, either using this character, entering the ",{"t":"Ante Chamber stage","r":"stage:ante-chamber-stage"},", using ",{"i":"Sprite-Secretino_Dagsson.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:secretino-dagsson"}," ",{"t":"Secretino Dagsson","r":"character:secretino-dagsson"}," or any of the other Ante Chamber characters would allow for the usage of Survarots. With the introduction of the ",{"i":"Sprite-Survarocchi.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:survarocchi"}," ",{"t":"Survarocchi","r":"relic:survarocchi"},", this is no longer the case."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Chicot","x":"https://balatrowiki.org/w/Chicot"}," on the ",{"t":"Balatro Wiki","x":"https://balatrowiki.org"}]}]}],"subs":[]}]}